<title>EU:  OFFICIAL JOURNAL CONTENTS - OJ L 81 OF MARCH 21, 1997.</title>
<headline>OFFICIAL JOURNAL CONTENTS - OJ L 81 OF MARCH 21, 1997.</headline>
<text>
<p>*</p>
<p>COMMON POSITION of 17 March 1997 defined by the Council on the basis of Article J.2 of the Treaty on European Union, on restrictive measures aimed at persons having perpetrated violent acts during the incidents in Mostar on 10 February 1997 (97/193/CFSP) END OF DOCUMENT.</p>
